        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                "word": "silencieusement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                        "entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière silencieuse; en silence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3fd4578-977a-4ede-a28c-6da71ac36409",
                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                "text": "Afin que, retraçant aux jeunes gens le souvenir des hommes illustres, ils invitassent silencieusement à les imiter,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3a6852b-026e-4554-9b7b-fe2a15eca486",
                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                "text": "Dans ces murailles, les murmures, les lamentations, les appels à la justice et les cris de la souffrance meurent tous silencieusement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a054a63-ecd4-4b52-a608-8d6eb528a387",
                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                "text": "Les uns allaient rendre leurs armes ; d'autres, qui les avaient abandonnées déjà, marchaient silencieusement, les mains ballantes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13b75681-d0e5-4694-9e1e-8f59cfcec567",
                                "sense_id": "122c189e-bd89-3630-ba3d-37f3888a785d",
                                "text": "Le Père Directeur, qui était venu me rejoindre dans mon bureau de l’hôpital , ne me répondit rien et continua à tirer silencieusement sur son long fume-cigare."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "997b2293-8e83-34a8-aa6b-1aaf31d8991a",
                        "entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sans faire parler de soi."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "956d9b5a-c17c-429a-9918-18f7fcd0b34f",
                                "sense_id": "997b2293-8e83-34a8-aa6b-1aaf31d8991a",
                                "text": "Naguère l'artiste rebuté par la stupidité de la foule se repliait dans sa coquille, œuvrait silencieusement, en garde contre le pompiérisme odieux de son époque, attendant son heure qui sonnait toujours trop tard."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1bbab9b-4e0a-4929-a702-2ad31349bbf1",
                        "source_entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "noiselessly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "noiselessly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                        "entry_id": "0da88b86-e408-316f-a54a-41f906f08760",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a quiet manner, without any noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4840c4b9-cb46-49b2-95c4-46efbfa8a8b3",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "Noiselessly she laid the clematis and wattle on her bed, then stood near the covered face, and, looking down at her untied bootlaces, sighed an impatient sigh always well known and understood by this now unresponsive father."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "50472295-0828-4058-9ad9-1ff7bfb21f9d",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "Not thirty paces behind the two she crouched--Sabor, the huge lioness--lashing her tail. Cautiously she moved a great padded paw forward, noiselessly placing it before she lifted the next. Thus she advanced; her belly low, almost touching the surface of the ground--a great cat preparing to spring upon its prey."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcea5b79-89d8-41d4-94d8-71fff74dbbb5",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "I now, O friend, whom noiselessly the snows / Settle around, and whose small chamber grows / Dusk as the sloping window takes its load:"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "017af60b-60c8-4161-a301-beae3a6c21de",
                                                "sense_id": "ee5fceb4-6216-38b3-9dce-f88b234dca37",
                                                "text": "The Bat—they called him the Bat. Like a bat he chose the night hours for his work of rapine; like a bat he struck and vanished, pouncingly, noiselessly; like a bat he never showed himself to the face of the day."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df054357-f8fa-4cde-a7ff-2a2e171e2926",
                        "source_entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "quietly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "quietly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54591f42-6dcf-3765-ae69-a703fa8cbaf8",
                                        "entry_id": "cb74771d-09fc-385a-8146-2745d8ff403a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a quiet manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4326ee50-f560-403b-a186-fd887ddddd83",
                                                "sense_id": "54591f42-6dcf-3765-ae69-a703fa8cbaf8",
                                                "text": "When Timothy and Julia hurried up the staircase to the bedroom floor, where a considerable commotion was taking place, Tim took Barry Leach with him.[…]. The captive made no resistance and came not only quietly but in a series of eager little rushes like a timid dog on a choke chain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "112f23b2-d2f0-4928-8a1d-07d91f79090b",
                        "source_entry_id": "452d291e-f59a-32f2-b385-34bf79b782f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "silently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "silently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                        "entry_id": "d3aaf0d9-85cb-3950-96cc-2596731d1cf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a silent manner; making no noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dd1de5e-2418-443b-bc85-8832823a89fa",
                                                "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                                "text": "It often happens that the most important results in the natural world are brought about by causes which operate silently, if not imperceptibly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db4e2e38-6298-4fab-afb0-ee64d924855e",
                                                "sense_id": "73db7210-4dfc-33b7-9d1d-a3d4c6c99ec3",
                                                "text": "Frederick, I presume, at this late hour of four, may be snatching a morsel of dinner; his orderlies are silently speeding, plans taken, orders given: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0c4f1bd-e3dd-3db0-ac81-e039fd2f4797",
                                        "entry_id": "d3aaf0d9-85cb-3950-96cc-2596731d1cf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of an edit or change to a text, without explicit acknowledgment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f21bbce9-e5e9-401a-9362-d9bccc78bf57",
                                                "sense_id": "c0c4f1bd-e3dd-3db0-ac81-e039fd2f4797",
                                                "text": "There never was an English-language text, either in 1561 or 1859. Yule and Burnell have silently provided a translation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8ab6e47b-c56f-4fa4-84e1-78326a01ba04",
